[English Terms]

All contents of this repository — including but not limited to the
game program (HTML / JavaScript), narrative and lorebook texts, UI
design, runtime-converted 3D models and textures, music files,
screenshots, and documentation — are proprietary works protected by
copyright law. This file is NOT an open-source license and grants no
open-source rights.

1. Permitted

  1. Online play: playing the game via the official page at
     https://ekibenya.github.io/RitusZhou/.
  2. Offline play: downloading official release packages from this
     repository's Releases page and playing on your personal devices.
  3. SillyTavern loading: loading the officially released HTML file
     in your personal SillyTavern environment, which is treated as
     personal play.
  4. Sharing links: sharing the repository URL, the online play URL,
     or the Releases download URL with others.

2. Prohibited (without prior written permission from the copyright
   holder)

  1. Copying, modifying, or translating this work, or creating any
     derivative works (including fan remakes, modified versions,
     re-skins, or ports).
  2. Redistributing any file in this repository in any form,
     including mirroring, re-uploading, or repackaging to other
     platforms or file-sharing services.
  3. Using this work or any part of it for any commercial purpose.
  4. Extracting, converting, or separately using the 3D models,
     textures, music, or other assets contained in this work (such
     assets are additionally bound by their original vendors'
     commercial licenses).
  5. Removing or altering this notice or any copyright information
     within the work.

3. Miscellaneous

  1. The public hosting of this repository on GitHub exists solely
